  "goodToKnow": "Absegnen (colloquial) means to approve or sign off on, often formally or as a rubber stamp: Der Aufsichtsrat hat die Fusion abgesegnet. It comes from segnen (to bless), with a slightly ironic touch. Formal synonyms: genehmigen, billigen, bewilligen. Der Segen is a blessing: seinen Segen geben (to give one's blessing). Separable: segnete ab, abgesegnet."
